  "decision": {
    "productionEnabled": false,
    "exportForBrowser": false,
    "reason": "The new head demonstrably learns and preserves its body parent, but its paper identities destroy useful patterns on many evaluation photos. Running reconstruction against those wrong masks would not establish a quality improvement.",
